comment: LlamaStash README/site demo: the init wizard driven by hand, then a TUI
comment: tour on a live daemon that already serves a generic engine.
comment: Flow: `llamastash init` (existing llama-server, a small model pasted by HF
comment: id), then "Launch the TUI now?" hands into the TUI: launch gemma-4-E2B on
comment: llama.cpp, chat with it, refilter to the running flash-next-halogen row and
comment: show its Requests tab, HuggingFace search, theme cycle.
comment:
comment: Prereqs: a daemon with a running generic entry named flash-next-halogen
comment: and some proxy requests already sent to it (by name and by alias), so the
comment: Requests tab has rows; gemma-4-E2B-it-Q4_K_M in the HF cache and not running.
comment: The wizard writes config.yaml: save `git diff` of it and `git apply -R` after.
comment:
comment: Capture (131x34 to match assets/tui.gif). The shell is a plain bash with a
comment: one-glyph prompt, run through a wrapper that exports the PATH llama-server
comment: resolves on, e.g. `exec env PS1='❯ ' bash --noprofile --norc`:
comment:   python3 scripts/tui/harness.py scripts/tui/demo.prog <out> <shell-wrapper> \
comment:     --cast <out>/demo.raw.cast --cols 131 --rows 34
comment: `waitfor` steps absorb load and download time. Trim to ~36 s, no gap over
comment: 0.45 s, holding the chat answer, the Requests table and each theme (raw times):
comment:   scripts/tui/trim_cast.py assets/demo.raw.cast assets/demo.cast \
comment:     --band 0.1:0.45 --speed 2.6 --fast 10.0:18.5:4 --hold 45.8:1.0 --hold 59.9:2.0 --hold 79.4:0.6 \
comment:     --hold 80.7:0.6 --hold 82.0:0.6 --hold 83.3:0.6 --hold 84.5:0.8 --end 86
comment:   agg --font-size 16 assets/demo.cast assets/tui.gif
comment: The 7 README/site stills (tui_3 is also the site's hero-static.png) and init.gif:
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 5.61 assets/tui_1.png   # init summary
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 15.11 assets/tui_2.png   # chat
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 21.61 assets/tui_3.png   # Requests tab
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 27.11 assets/tui_4.png   # HF search
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 29.81 assets/tui_5.png   # themes
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 30.91 assets/tui_6.png
comment:   cast_frames.py frame assets/demo.cast 32.01 assets/tui_7.png
comment:   cast_frames.py clip assets/demo.cast /tmp/init.cast --end 5.66
comment:   agg --font-size 16 /tmp/init.cast assets/init.gif

# ── let the shell paint its prompt, then start the wizard ──
wait:1.5
type:llamastash init
key:enter
waitfor:Install method
wait:1.5

# ── Install method: pick "Use existing binary" (3rd option) ──
key:down
wait:0.5
key:down
wait:0.7
key:enter
waitfor:Pick a model
wait:1.5

# ── Pick a model: walk down to "Paste an HF repo id…" (below the 10 picks) ──
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.25
key:down
wait:0.6
key:enter
wait:1.5

# ── paste a small model's HF id (single file via :filename, so it's quick) ──
type:lmstudio-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-GGUF:gemma-4-E2B-it-Q4_K_M.gguf
wait:0.8
key:enter
waitfor:Write config?|180
wait:1.5

# ── Write config? → Yes ──
key:enter
waitfor:Patch AI tool configs
wait:1.5

# ── Patch AI tool configs? → leave all unchecked, just confirm ──
key:enter
waitfor:Launch the TUI now?|60
wait:1.5

# ── Launch the TUI now? → Yes (hands straight into the TUI) ──
key:enter
waitfor:Models [
wait:3

# ── launch gemma-4-E2B on llama.cpp: filter to it, Enter drills in, Enter launches ──
type:/
wait:0.4
type:gemma-4-E2B
wait:1
key:enter
wait:1.2
key:enter
waitfor:ready · 128k ctx|120
wait:1.5

# ── chat gemma right after launching it (it is auto-selected; r collapses reasoning) ──
type:C
wait:1.5
type:r
wait:0.5
type:e
type:Hello
wait:1.2
key:enter
waitfor:finished:|60
wait:2
snap:13-chat

# ── leave the chat (Esc: clear prompt, stop edit, back to the pane, to the list), refilter to flash-next, show its requests ──
key:esc
wait:0.6
key:esc
wait:0.6
key:esc
wait:0.6
key:esc
wait:0.6
type:M
wait:0.8
type:/
wait:0.4
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
key:backspace
type:flash-next
wait:1
key:enter
wait:0.7
type:Q
waitfor:Avg tok/s
wait:4
snap:15-requests

# ── clear the filter ──
key:esc
wait:0.5
type:/
wait:0.4
key:esc
wait:0.3
key:esc
wait:0.3
key:esc
wait:1.5

# ── pull from HuggingFace: search by name, show results ──
type:P
wait:2
type:Qwen3
waitfor:Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B
wait:2.5
snap:16-pull
key:esc
wait:0.5
key:esc
wait:0.5
key:esc
wait:1.2

# ── cycle through all five themes, landing back on Macchiato ──
type:t
wait:1.2
type:t
wait:1.2
type:t
wait:1.2
type:t
wait:1.2
type:t
wait:1.5
snap:17-end
wait:1
